<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Learn — RWAHQ</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about RWA tokenization, DeFi lending, and on-chain credit from scratch. Written for people who are confused by all the jargon.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://rwahq.dev/learn">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script is:inline src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased">

  <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-200/80">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex items-center justify-between h-14">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center"><i data-lucide="activity" class="w-4 h-4 text-white"></i></div>
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">RW<span class="text-blue-600">AHQ</span></span>
      </a>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Blog</a>
        <a href="/market" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Market</a>
        <a href="/learn" class="text-blue-600 font-medium">Learn</a>
        <a href="/tools" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Tools</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 to-indigo-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 text-purple-200 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 mb-4">
        <i data-lucide="graduation-cap" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Learning Hub
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3">Learn RWA From Zero</h1>
      <p class="text-purple-200 text-lg max-w-xl">Most RWA content assumes you already know crypto. We don't. These guides start from the very beginning.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Available Guides</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <a href="/blog/rwa-tokenization-guide" class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors"><i data-lucide="landmark" class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">What is RWA?</h3>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-green-50 text-green-700 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">READY</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">The full picture: what tokenization means, why institutions care, and whether any of this actually works yet.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-medium flex items-center gap-1">Read guide <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/defi-lending-explained" class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-purple-100 transition-colors"><i data-lucide="layers" class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">DeFi Lending 101</h3>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-green-50 text-green-700 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">READY</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">How Aave, Compound, and Morpho actually work. Where the yield comes from. What the risks are.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-medium flex items-center gap-1">Read guide <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
      </a>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 opacity-60">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">MiCA Regulation</h3>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">IN PROGRESS</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">What MiCA actually says about tokenized assets, what changed in December 2024, and what it means for you.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium">Publishing July 2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 opacity-60">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i data-lucide="coins" class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">Tokenized Gold Explained</h3>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">IN PROGRESS</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">XAUT vs PAXG vs physical gold. How redemption actually works. Whether the gold really exists in a vault.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium">Publishing July 2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 opacity-60">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i data-lucide="building-2" class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan-600"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">Real Estate Tokens</h3>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">PLANNED</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">How RealT works. Whether fractional ownership makes sense. The legal complexity nobody talks about.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium">Coming Q3 2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 opacity-60">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i data-lucide="file-text" class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600"></i></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">How to Read Audit Reports</h3>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">PLANNED</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Trail of Bits, OpenZeppelin, Spearbit — what these firms actually check and what they don't.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium">Coming Q3 2025</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 border-t border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center"><i data-lucide="activity" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white"></i></div>
        <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">RW<span class="text-blue-400">AHQ</span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">© 2025 RWAHQ. Not financial advice.</p>
      <a href="https://twitter.com/rwahq_io" class="hover:text-white transition-colors"><i data-lucide="twitter" class="w-4 h-4"></i></a>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <script is:inline>lucide.createIcons();</script>
</body>
</html>